Specifically, we use the top-$m$ candidates from the initial ranking as the input set for MDS, varying $m$ from 10 to 100 in increments of 10. 
Our experiments include four individual pointwise methods and their various aggregations, averaging the NDCG@10 scores on both the TREC DL and BEIR benchmarks with Flan-t5-large.

