    \]
    We will maintain the same (dimension-free) values of $(\gamma,\delta)$, and further set $\tau = c_{\ref{lem:perturbed-gapped-state-separation}}(\gamma)/4$.
    The remaining parameters will grow with $N$, as follows:
    \begin{align*}
        L &= N^{0.1} \ge 2 \cdot 3^D, &
        \eps &= N^{-0.5} = L^{-5}, &
        K &= \lceil 1/\eps \rceil.
