Corollary~\ref{c:Eurostar} follows from Lemma~\ref{l:lastDay} using the following lemma.

\ble\label{l:inaugural1}
For all $k_0 > 0$, there exist constants $C,h_0,N' > 0$ such that for all $k \geq k_0$, $k \notin \mathcal{J}$, $h \leq h_0$, $u-u_h$ satisfying \eqref{e:Galerkin_ortho} and $w_h \in V_k$, 
