\begin{proof}
We apply Lemma \ref{l:lastDay} with any cover $\{\chi_i\}_{i = 1}^M$ satisfying \eqref{e:crazyCover0} and with $N = 2p$. 
By the definition of $X$ \eqref{e:defX} 
