We now renumber
$$
\chi_1^\circ,\ldots,\chi_{\domainnumber_\Int}^\circ, \chi_1^\x,\ldots,\chi_{\domainnumber_\Int}^\x, \chi_{\domainnumber_{\Int+1}},\ldots,\chi_M \quad\tas \{\varphi_{i,1}\}_{1 \leq i \leq \widehat{\domainnumber}},
