\paragraph{Definition of suitable cut-off functions.}

Let $\{\varphi_{i,0}\}_{i = 1}^{\widehat{\domainnumber}}$ be a partition of unity subordinate to the cover \eqref{e:crazyCoverTilde} of $\Omega$, and thus such that $\varphi_{i,0}\prec \varphi_{i,1}$.

