\paragraph{Bound on $X^-$.}

We first show that 
\begin{align}
\nonumber
X^- &\leq C \begin{pmatrix}
\mathcal{C} (\Hdiag_{\Int,\Int} k)^{2p} & \mathcal{C}  (\Hdiag_{\Int,\Int} k)^{2p} & \Hmin_{\Int,\Pml}(N) k^N 
\end{pmatrix} X \\
& \hspace{5cm} + C\begin{pmatrix}
