    	\centering
    	\includegraphics[width=0.5\textwidth]{SpecialCase.png}
    	\caption{When the plane of the ellipse (in red) and the plane spanned by the velocity vector and the $Y$-axis of the camera frame (in blue) have the same normal vector, the projection of the conic in the world frame is a conic in the pushbroom image.}
