\begin{highlights}
\item Technology maturing greatly affects performance of alternative aircraft designs;
\item Under trend demand, emissions peak by 2040, regardless of future fleet and energy availability;
\item Paris Agreement targets will require demand management or extra energy availability;
\item Aircraft with alternative energy carriers allows for better use of energy resources;
\item Scientific computing libraries allowed for lighter implementation and faster execution.
