\subsection{Data Sources}
We considered both structured and unstructured data as input to our process. We wanted to extract information from authoritative sources, so we used the official conference proceedings and the conference website as input to our process. Table~\ref{tab:data_sources} illustrates the different sources we used in our process. These sources contained most of the information we wanted to extract.  If the data has already been extracted and exposed in structured formats, especially in RDF (Resource Description Framework), such as DBLP and Scholarly Data, we reuse them. 

