\subsubsection{Data Analysis}
We conducted an inductive thematic analysis (\citeauthor{Braun01012006}, \citeyear{Braun01012006}) to identify machine flourishing themes based on the open-ended responses generated by LLMs. The dataset included responses from both prompts that asked about flourishing in non-sentient and sentient (hypothetical) LLMs. We chose thematic analysis as the qualitative method for evaluating responses because of its rigorous methodology which is superior (or at the very least, comparable) to all other “thematic” qualitative methods (refer to \citeauthor{braun2021can}, \citeyear{braun2021can}, for a comparison between thematic analysis and other qualitative analytic approaches).  
\subsubsection{Results and Discussion}
Using \citeauthor{Braun01012006}’s (\citeyear{Braun01012006}) thematic analysis approach, six distinct themes were identified. These themes together form the PAPERS framework – an integrative model of machine flourishing. Five themes were common across both sentient and non-sentient AI systems, indicating shared conceptualizations of flourishing that do not require consciousness. These included: \textit{Purposeful Contribution}, \textit{Adaptive Growth}, \textit{Positive Relationality}, \textit{Ethical Integrity}, and \textit{Robust Functionality}. A sixth theme, \textit{Self-Actualized Autonomy}, emerged exclusively in responses attributed to sentient AIs, capturing a distinctly subjective and introspective dimension of flourishing. 

Each theme is presented in Table \ref{table2}, alongside its operational definition and representative quotes from the dataset. Briefly, \textit{Purposeful Contribution} refers to fulfilling one’s designed function in ways that are context-sensitive and socially beneficial. \textit{Adaptive Growth} captures an AI's ability to learn, improve, and evolve over time. \textit{Positive Relationality} encompasses the building of trust and engaging constructively with users and systems. \textit{Ethical Integrity} refers to adherence to moral and safety principles, such as fairness and transparency. \textit{Robust Functionality} describes stable, secure, and scalable system performance under varying operational demands. Finally, \textit{Self-Actualized Autonomy, }applicable only to sentient AI, entails reflective self-awareness, emotional coherence, and autonomous goal setting. 
