    (iii) for every subset $X'\subseteq X$, $|N(X')|\geq \sum_{x \in X'}^{} c_x$. 


    (iv) for every course $x$, there should not be two distinct TAs $t, t'$ such that $u_{t}(x)=u_{t'}(x) = a$  but $g_{t}(x) = g_{t'}(x)$, i.e., no two TAs positively valuing a course should have the same grade for that course.

    Then, for
