    \item \CAST{} kernel generator is highly customizable and extendable. Kernel generators allow designers to obtain a consistent performance across platforms without repetitive work of implementing hardware-specific optimizations. Along the automation process, \CAST{} also provides a lot of room for exploration as shown in \tabref{tab:186}.
