\CAST{} employs tile-based iteration to perform gate fusion. The pseudo-code is provided in Algorithm \ref{alg:1}. This algorithm takes in a CircuitTile $T$ and an unsigned integer $k$ as the input. It traverses through all gate blocks and fuse the blocks. During the execution, the number of qubits of the fused gate should stay below $k$ to avoid fragments. The algorithm returns \textbf{true} if and only if there is at least one pair of gate block merged during the execution.


