The multimodal T2I100M dataset is a special case, since the dataset vectors are text embeddings while the queries are image embeddings.
Thus, the corresponding query workloads represent Out-Of-Distribution (OOD) queries. 
For this reason, we study this dataset separately. % in a dedicated subsequent subsection.
