The IVF index parameters were $nlist=1000$ for GIST1M and GLOVE1M and $nlist=10000$ for DEEP100M and SIFT100M.
We also set $nprobe=100$ for GLOVE1M, $nprobe=150$ for DEEP100M and SIFT100M and $nprobe=200$ for GIST1M.
These parameters allowed all our IVF indexes to reach very high recalls: $0.996$ on average across all datasets.
}

