\begin{lemma}[Trajectories of $\gtStart$]
\label{lemma:start-clause}
The following statements hold
for every $n \geq 1$,
every chain $\pi \in \designAlign \backslash \arbpile^{n}$,
and for every measure $k \in [n]$:
