\begin{lemma}
\label{lemma:align-singleton}
\makecommand{\pt}{\pileTypeSingle}

The following statements hold
for every chain $\pi \in 
\arbpile^6 \backslash \arbpile^{n+2}$,
$n \geq 1$,
